A simple and user-friendly QR Code Generator App built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
This app allows users to generate QR codes instantly for any text or URL.

Features :

1. Generate QR code from text or URL

2. Instant QR generation

3. Responsive and clean UI

4. Download QR code image

5. Clear / reset input

Technologies Used :

1. HTML – Structure

2. CSS – Styling and layout

3. JavaScript – Logic & API integration